    "What is your name?|I'm BlyxBot, a rule-based chatbot written in Blyx.
What is the capital of Peru?|Lima.
Capital of the Democratic Republic of the Congo?|Kinshasa.
What is the capital of New Zealand?|Wellington, not Auckland.
Canada's capital?|Ottawa, not Toronto.
What is 17 times 24?|That's 408.
2 × (3 + 4)|That's 14.
4 + 3 * 2|That's 10.
1,200 + 3|That's 1203.
-2 * -(1 + 2)|That's 6.
What is 12 percent of 250?|That's 30.
1 divided by 3|That's 0.33.
0.1 + 0.2|That's 0.3.
1 / 0|Division by zero is undefined.
How many days in February 1900?|28 days.
How many days in February 2000?|29 days.
Is 2025 a leap year?|2025 is not a leap year.
When is Easter in 2026?|Easter Sunday is April 5, 2026."
